<title>USA: Washington Trust says John Warren named CEO.</title>
<headline>Washington Trust says John Warren named CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WESTERLY, R.I. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Trust Bancorp Inc said Tuesday it named John Warren chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company said Warren was previously president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said he replaced John Kirby, who is retiring as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company said it made the announcement at its annual meeting Tuesday in Westerly.</p>
<p>No further information from the company was immediately available.</p>
